<header class="ref-head yr-head"><p class="cty-kicker">Year by year · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p><h1 class="research-title">1939</h1><p class="ref-lede">1939 in world history: 49 events, 14 births, 18 deaths, 1 work, 4 states founded and 7 that came to an end. 713 recorded states existed that year.</p></header>
